{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124410","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1012441001:0":{"text":"ブライアン、エルーナが焦ってるみたいだけど。何か言われたの？","source_cn":"布莱恩，艾洛娜和你说什么了？它好像很着急。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF052CDDDFA1FA309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012441002:0":{"text":"ターラン村の様子が気になって、エルーナを見に行かせたんだ。","source_cn":"我担心塔兰村的情况，派艾洛娜回去了一趟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED40D56E2C240702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012441003:0":{"text":"どうやら、流光の樹の影響で、恋人たちの祈りの腐敗が悪化しているらしい、イヴォンヌ殿も……かなり酷い状態だそうだ。","source_cn":"它告诉我，受流荧树影响，情人之愿的腐化越来越严重，而伊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F0EC95A5FCC681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012441004:1":{"text":"一刻も早くターラン村に戻る必要がある。","source_cn":"恐怕我们得尽快返回塔兰村。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED20F8419D5DBA87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012441005:1":{"text":"私もイヴォンヌは心配ですが、イミルの捜索を続けなくていいのですか？せっかく手がかりが手に入ったのに……","source_cn":"虽然我也很担心伊温，但是，不继续追查伊米尔吗？好不容易...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1BCAE66B9B9BC26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_